# Lion Sash: "{W}: Exile target card from a graveyard. If it was a permanent card, put a +1/+1 counter on this permanent",
# "Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each +1/+1 counter on this Equipment" and Reconfigure {2}. Bot1 exiles the sacrificed
# Black Lotus with the Sash for a counter on turn 1. On turn 3 it reconfigures the Sash onto Ornithopter, which becomes
# a 1/3, and the Sash is no longer a creature. On turn 5 it unattaches it: the Sash is a 2/2 creature again (its counter)
# and Ornithopter a 0/2.

